(1) That the Cobb County Emergency Management Agency activate the Emergency Operations Plan;
(2) That the following sections of the Official Code of Cobb County, Georgia be implemented: [If deemed appropriate, choose from the following: Section 34-5, Overcharging; Section 34-6, Registration of Building and Repair Services; Section 34-7, Closed or Restricted Areas and Curfews]; and
(3) That the following measures also be implemented: [If deemed appropriate, select items from Section 34-2(a)(4)c, d or such other measures as appropriate.]
ENTERED at [TIME] on [DATE]. [Signed] Chairman, Cobb County Board of Commissioners
